<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Parcelamento — iPhoneCenter</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html,
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100%;
      background: #050608;
      color: #f6f7f9;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      padding: 24px 16px;
    }

    .topbar {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      padding: 10px 4px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: #f6f7f9;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .brand img {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 9px;
    }

    .voltar {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: #f6f7f9;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: #101216;
    }

    .voltar:hover {
      background: #181b21;
    }

    .parcelamento-page {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .parcelamento-box {
      background: #101216;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border-radius: 26px;
      padding: 32px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #8f96a3;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1.8px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 32px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .produto {
      margin: 0 0 24px;
      color: #aeb4bf;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .preco {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding: 18px;
      background: #181b21;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .preco span {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: #8f96a3;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .preco strong {
      color: #22c55e;
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .parcelas {
      display: grid;
      gap: 9px;
    }

    .parcela {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 52px;
      padding: 13px 16px;
      background: #181b21;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      border-radius: 14px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .parcela .numero {
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .parcela strong {
      color: #22c55e;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .parcela.sem-juros {
      border-color: rgba(34,197,94,.25);
    }

    .sem-juros-label {
      margin-left: 8px;
      color: #8f96a3;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .observacao {
      margin: 20px 0 0;
      color: #8f96a3;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body {
        padding: 14px 10px;
      }

      .topbar {
        padding: 6px 2px;
      }

      .brand span {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .voltar {
        padding: 9px 12px;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .parcelamento-box {
        padding: 24px 16px;
        border-radius: 22px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 27px;
      }

      .parcela {
        min-height: 50px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">
      <img src="/assets/logo.png" alt="iPhoneCenter">
      <span>iPhoneCenter</span>
    </a>
    <a class="voltar" href="/">Voltar ao catálogo</a>
  </header>

  <main class="parcelamento-page">
    <section class="parcelamento-box">

      <div class="eyebrow">PAGAMENTO</div>

      <h1>Opções de parcelamento</h1>

      <p class="produto">
        iPhone 15 — 128 GB
      </p>

      <div class="preco">
        <span>Preço do produto</span>
        <strong>R$ 2.899,99</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="parcelas">

        <div class="parcela sem-juros">
          <span class="numero">1x <span class="sem-juros-label">sem juros</span></span>
          <strong>R$ 2.899,99</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="parcela">
          <span class="numero">2x</span>
          <strong>R$ 1.508,00</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="parcela">
          <span class="numero">3x</span>
          <strong>R$ 1.019,33</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="parcela">
          <span class="numero">4x</span>
          <strong>R$ 774,75</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="parcela">
          <span class="numero">5x</span>
          <strong>R$ 628,50</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="parcela">
          <span class="numero">6x</span>
          <strong>R$ 531,67</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="parcela">
          <span class="numero">7x</span>
          <strong>R$ 462,50</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="parcela">
          <span class="numero">8x</span>
          <strong>R$ 409,87</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="parcela">
          <span class="numero">9x</span>
          <strong>R$ 368,44</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="parcela">
          <span class="numero">10x</span>
          <strong>R$ 336,40</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="parcela">
          <span class="numero">11x</span>
          <strong>R$ 310,04</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="parcela">
          <span class="numero">12x</span>
          <strong>R$ 287,08</strong>
        </div>

      </div>

      <p class="observacao">
        Os valores das parcelas são calculados conforme as condições de parcelamento apresentadas no site.
      </p>

    </section>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
